FUSION BARRIER vs KERNEL QUALITY
====================================================================================================
  tile [512, 3072] @ 2 B = 3.15 MB
  unfused floor per call = 2 tiles = 6.29 MB (one read in, one write out)

config                      device ms   ms/call    HBM MB   MB/call  vs floor    MBU%
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
silu/nki/n1                     0.051    0.0515      18.9     18.87     3.00x   46.6%
silu/torch/n1                   0.027    0.0269       6.3      6.29     1.00x   32.6%
rmsnorm/nki/n1                  0.091    0.0909      18.9     18.88     3.00x   28.0%
rmsnorm/torch/n1                0.038    0.0384       7.9      7.88     1.25x   28.4%
silu/nki/n28                    0.609    0.0218     188.7      6.74     1.07x   43.1%
